{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04386","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十二 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"呦呦南山鹿，罹罟以媒和。\n招摇青桂树，幽蠹亦成科。\n世情甘近习，荣耀纷如何。\n怨憎未相复，亲爱生祸罗。\n瑶台倾巧笑，玉杯殒双蛾。\n谁见枯城蘖，青青成斧柯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}